                "text": "Our economy had 0% inflation in July.  Prices for gas, clothes, air fares, appliances and more all went down. We are on the right track, but still have work to do.  Congress must pass the Inflation Reduction Act ASAP to lower healthcare, prescription drug and energy costs.",
